焉。」羲之自為之傳，述靈異之跡甚多，不可詳記。玄自後莫測所終，好道者皆謂之羽化矣。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line122:m0098","start":98,"end":99,"surface":"玄","person_id":"972_dh9_hz4","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line122:m0101","start":101,"end":103,"surface":"遠遊","person_id":"972_dh9_hz4","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line122:m0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"羲之","person_id":"326_faf_cd3","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line122:m0145","start":145,"end":146,"surface":"玄","person_id":"972_dh9_hz4","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line122:m0147","start":147,"end":149,"surface":"羲之","person_id":"326_faf_cd3","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line122:m0173","start":173,"end":176,"surface":"左元放","person_id":"nqv_68w_t1g","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line122:m0190","start":190,"end":192,"surface":"羲之","person_id":"326_faf_cd3","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line122:m0210","start":210,"end":211,"surface":"玄","person_id":"972_dh9_hz4","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":122,"last_line":122,"raw_start":7547,"raw_end":7787,"revision_id":2603570},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family","book_id":"b-jinshu-080","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-0